        "id": 1306837
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-06-06T10:10:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I mean the uid list is changed when VPN is connecting in below line.\nhttps://cs.corp.google.com/aosp-master/frameworks/base/services/core/java/com/android/server/connectivity/Vpn.java?q\u003dVpn.java\u0026dr\u0026l\u003d979\n\nSo for VPN, it will be:\n1. CONNECTING\n2. updateUid(nai, null, NC)\n3. CONNECTED\n\nWhat I\u0027m trying to do is to prevent from calling into handleLockdownOrVpnChanged(vpn, null, NC) at step 2 (l.5905).\nBut explicit do it after 3. (l.6586)\n\nI think this is most confusing part in this change.",
